# Streams: append-only log with consumer groups.
XADD orders * customer 1 total 19.99
XADD orders * customer 2 total 5.00
XLEN orders
XRANGE orders - +
XREAD COUNT 10 STREAMS orders 0

XGROUP CREATE orders processors $ MKSTREAM
XREADGROUP GROUP processors worker-1 COUNT 5 STREAMS orders >
XACK orders processors 1700000000000-0
